  hook=dict(text="Lily had a quiet picnic under the fairy-door tree in the Whispering Forest. She opened her storybook and read and read. Then, pop! Something jumped out of the bushes! When we tell a story, we need two kinds of past: the long thing that was going on, and the short thing that suddenly happened. Let's put Lily's afternoon on a timeline."),
